WEBVTT

00:00:08.221 --> 00:00:09.581
(BOB MUMBLING)

00:00:09.661 --> 00:00:12.421
(IMITATES DASH)
"Hey, Dad, it's okay.

00:00:12.501 --> 00:00:14.301
"I'll just wait for Mom
to get home."

00:00:15.181 --> 00:00:17.901
As if she could...
I know how to...

00:00:18.821 --> 00:00:20.181
I can do math.

00:00:25.941 --> 00:00:27.221
(GROANS)

00:00:30.141 --> 00:00:32.501
Oh, brother...
(MUMBLING)

00:00:35.181 --> 00:00:36.781
(IMITATES DASH) Wait for Mom!

00:00:38.341 --> 00:00:40.501
What am I,
a substitute parent?

00:00:43.301 --> 00:00:45.181
It's not my fault
they changed math.

00:00:53.901 --> 00:00:56.221
Come on, buddy. Come on.

00:00:56.381 --> 00:00:58.941
I think I understand
your math assignment.

00:00:59.101 --> 00:01:02.661
We still have some time
to finish it before your test.

00:01:02.821 --> 00:01:04.701
So first, you wanna put
all the numbers

00:01:04.781 --> 00:01:06.541
by themselves on one side.

00:01:06.741 --> 00:01:08.581
...you change the sign.

00:01:08.741 --> 00:01:11.381
That means a plus becomes
a minus and a minus...

00:01:11.541 --> 00:01:12.821
You got it?

00:01:12.981 --> 00:01:14.381
Yeah, baby!

00:01:24.501 --> 00:01:26.141
(INDISTINCT CHATTER)

00:01:28.381 --> 00:01:30.181
Oh. Uh, hello.

00:01:30.981 --> 00:01:32.341
We're in a new house.

00:01:32.501 --> 00:01:35.501
I did write my address
on your locker...

00:01:35.661 --> 00:01:37.541
in permanent ink.

00:01:37.741 --> 00:01:39.741
Oh, is that what that is?

00:01:39.901 --> 00:01:41.221
Did you forget?

00:01:41.381 --> 00:01:43.421
Forget what?

00:01:44.341 --> 00:01:46.381
(CHUCKLING) That's funny.

00:01:49.541 --> 00:01:50.861
Points for funny.

00:01:52.301 --> 00:01:54.381
Oh, was it the weird outfit?

00:01:54.501 --> 00:01:56.701
-(CHUCKLES)
-Because there's a reason.

00:01:56.861 --> 00:01:58.941
I'm in a drama class...

00:01:59.101 --> 00:02:01.261
and they just wanna do
Shakespeare...

00:02:01.421 --> 00:02:03.221
but they're like, "Try to make
it relevant for the kids."

00:02:03.381 --> 00:02:05.461
So, like, "Oh, superheroes!
Kids love superheroes."

00:02:05.541 --> 00:02:06.541
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:02:06.621 --> 00:02:07.741
You wanna wear
one kind of tights...

00:02:07.821 --> 00:02:08.821
and then they're like,

00:02:08.941 --> 00:02:10.381
"No, wear these other
kind of tights."

00:02:10.461 --> 00:02:11.541
(STAMMERS) Do I know you?

00:02:20.541 --> 00:02:22.661
Many say
your speech today is critical.

00:02:22.821 --> 00:02:25.261
Both sides just want the best
for their people.

00:02:25.421 --> 00:02:29.021
We are so close to finally
getting peace in the region.

00:02:29.221 --> 00:02:30.901
I haven't done this
in a while.

00:02:31.061 --> 00:02:33.421
This is good.
The train gives us momentum.

00:02:33.581 --> 00:02:35.501
Just go out there
and be your charming self...

00:02:35.661 --> 00:02:36.901
and capitalize on it.

00:02:37.061 --> 00:02:39.421
Ms. Elastigirl,
they're ready for you.

00:02:39.581 --> 00:02:41.221
Hey, stretch a leg.

00:02:43.261 --> 00:02:44.541
Thank you, Chad. It was fun.

00:02:45.221 --> 00:02:47.101
-Ambassador, your documents.
-We're moving to the rooftop.

00:02:48.381 --> 00:02:50.221
Oh, Madame Ambassador, hello!

00:02:50.381 --> 00:02:51.741
Oh, you are Elastigirl!

00:02:51.941 --> 00:02:54.021
This is why now
I'm shaking your hand.

00:02:54.181 --> 00:02:56.221
It was so sad
when you went underground.

00:02:56.381 --> 00:03:00.181
I am glad to see
you back in your shiny outfit.

00:03:00.341 --> 00:03:01.661
That means so much
coming from you.

00:03:01.781 --> 00:03:02.781
Good luck with your speech.

00:03:02.941 --> 00:03:04.341
This way, Ambassador.

00:03:04.541 --> 00:03:05.661
(STAMMERS)
Bring lasting peace!

00:03:05.821 --> 00:03:07.581
I will, when you defeat evil.

00:03:07.661 --> 00:03:09.661
(CHUCKLES) Okay.

00:03:09.821 --> 00:03:11.421
Three, two...

00:03:12.301 --> 00:03:13.741
For over 15 years,

00:03:13.821 --> 00:03:15.021
superheroes have been
in hiding.

00:03:15.181 --> 00:03:17.061
Forced into it by a society

00:03:17.141 --> 00:03:18.581
no longer willing
to support them.

00:03:18.741 --> 00:03:20.061
That may soon be changing...

00:03:20.261 --> 00:03:22.701
due to a growing movement
to bring the Supers back.

00:03:22.861 --> 00:03:24.781
Here, fresh on the heels
of her own

00:03:24.861 --> 00:03:26.581
heroic save
of a runaway train...

00:03:26.741 --> 00:03:29.861
and sporting a new look,
is the superhero, Elastigirl.

00:03:30.061 --> 00:03:31.381
-Welcome!
-Hello, Chad.

00:03:31.541 --> 00:03:33.621
All the polls are going
in your direction.

00:03:33.781 --> 00:03:34.981
That's true.
Things are good...

00:03:35.141 --> 00:03:36.261
Hello.

00:03:36.781 --> 00:03:38.381
Uh, hello?

00:03:38.541 --> 00:03:40.261
Do I have your attention?

00:03:40.621 --> 00:03:41.861
Yes, Chad.

00:03:42.021 --> 00:03:43.141
Of course I do.

00:03:43.301 --> 00:03:45.061
I'm appearing on your screen.

00:03:45.221 --> 00:03:48.141
Reading the words I'm saying
off of another screen.

00:03:48.301 --> 00:03:49.981
Screens are everywhere.

00:03:50.141 --> 00:03:52.501
-We are controlled by screens.
-(ELASTIGIRL WHIMPERING)

00:03:53.061 --> 00:03:57.581
And screens
are controlled by me...

00:03:58.021 --> 00:03:59.541
Screenslaver.

00:03:59.661 --> 00:04:00.661
Hey!

00:04:00.741 --> 00:04:03.021
SCREENSLAVER:
I control this broadcast...

00:04:03.181 --> 00:04:05.661
and this idiotic anchorman
you see before you.

00:04:05.821 --> 00:04:06.821
WOMAN: What's wrong with him?

00:04:06.901 --> 00:04:08.261
The signal's been hijacked.
I'll check it out.

00:04:08.421 --> 00:04:09.901
Don't look at any monitors.

00:04:10.101 --> 00:04:12.341
I could hijack
the ambassador's aerocade...

00:04:12.501 --> 00:04:14.541
while it's still airborne.

00:04:14.701 --> 00:04:16.421
Right, Elastigirl?

00:04:18.781 --> 00:04:20.941
Nearest window!
Where's the nearest window?

00:04:33.661 --> 00:04:35.261
-Oh, what's going on?
-Where's Elastigirl?

00:04:35.461 --> 00:04:36.821
(GROANS) Which one?

00:04:41.501 --> 00:04:43.181
(ELASTIGIRL GRUNTING)

00:04:45.821 --> 00:04:47.541
Elastigirl!
What are you doing here?

00:04:47.701 --> 00:04:49.781
The ambassador is in danger.
Which chopper is she...

00:04:49.941 --> 00:04:51.261
Look out!

00:04:52.941 --> 00:04:54.941
Follow them and get me close!

00:04:58.021 --> 00:05:00.421
Get out of the sky,
and touch down safely!

00:05:09.581 --> 00:05:12.181
-(GRUNTS)
-Stand down! It's Elastigirl.

00:05:13.021 --> 00:05:14.741
Stay in your seat, ma'am!

00:05:21.461 --> 00:05:23.501
-(GROANS, GASPS)
-We're under attack!

00:05:23.661 --> 00:05:26.381
Quick, go!
Protect the ambassador!

00:05:29.941 --> 00:05:30.941
Open the door!

00:05:31.141 --> 00:05:32.181
Do as she says!

00:05:34.461 --> 00:05:35.461
Can you all swim?

00:05:35.621 --> 00:05:36.821
-ALL: Yeah.
-No!

00:05:37.901 --> 00:05:39.821
(ALL SCREAMING)

